No denial.

Tsukihiko’s fingers tighten slightly in his.
“…Why?”

Chōbei’s gaze lingers on him.
Longer this time.
More deliberate.

“Because you calm down when I do.”

That—
lands.

Tsukihiko doesn’t have a response for that.
